    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Dispersion Pearson r = 0.99999994 (24-point grid rounds to 1.0 at five decimals) against a gate reference of 0.98, RMSE = 5.2e-4 against a tolerance of 0.05. Plate-versus-frame KS = 0.1879 (reference 0, which would be an identical histogram). Mask coherency, foreground fraction and circularity differ between plate and frame. The radial-FFT centroid is 1.9175 µm against analytic 2.072 µm. None of these measured values is copied onto its reference." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
